{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract vcf sv [-h] [-r REGION] [--caller {delly,pbsv,sniffles}] [--pacbio] [--ont]\n                         [--long-read] [--ccs] [--tandem-repeats TANDEM_REPEATS] [--help-all]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  -r, --region REGION   Delly/Sniffles: one region, a comma-separated list, or BED; pbsv: one\n                        region only.\n  --caller {delly,pbsv,sniffles}\n                        SV caller to use (default: sniffles for ONT or --long-read, pbsv/sniffles\n                        for PacBio, detected or flagged; else delly). pbsv is PacBio-only and is\n                        refused for ONT reads.\n  --pacbio              PacBio HiFi/CCS data: use pbsv (or sniffles if pbsv is missing) with CCS\n                        thresholds. Detected PacBio gets this automatically, without CCS\n                        thresholds for subreads (CLR).\n  --ont                 Oxford Nanopore data: use Sniffles (detected ONT input selects it\n                        automatically).\n  --long-read           Long-read data from any platform: use Sniffles unless --caller selects\n                        pbsv for PacBio reads.\n  --ccs                 Use pbsv CCS/HiFi thresholds when --caller pbsv is selected.\n  --tandem-repeats TANDEM_REPEATS\n                        Optional tandem-repeat BED for pbsv discover or Sniffles (recommended for\n                        long-read SV calling).\n  --help-all            Show this help with the advanced options too, and exit.\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\n1 advanced option not shown; 'wgsextract vcf sv --help-all' lists them.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract vcf sv --input sample.cram\n  wgsextract vcf sv --input hifi.bam --pacbio\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  sv.vcf.gz (Delly), pbsv.vcf.gz or sniffles.vcf.gz (+ .tbi).\n\nneeds:\n  bcftools, samtools, tabix; depending on options and inputs, also: delly,\n  pbsv, sambamba, sniffles; hours on a 30x genome.\n",
